        "shallow_wetlands"
      ],
      "source": "literature",
      "url": "https://www.turtle-sanctuary.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/RAFETUS_HUNTERS.pdf"
    },
    {
      "category": "habitat",
      "text": "It lives in large rivers, not only in small streams or ponds.",
